# Generated by scripts/build-fumola-wasm.sh.
#
# The small JS glue is committed, because branch previews deploy
# src/web/www verbatim and the page has to import it. The 5MB .wasm is
# deliberately NOT here: it lives in assets/fumola/ and is served from a CDN.
# Committing it into the deployed directory made GitHub Pages fail to build
# the whole hazelgrove/build site, which blocks previews for every branch.
src/web/www/fumola/*.d.ts
src/web/www/fumola/*.wasm
